#
# Fail-witness for the no-duplicate ban on EVIDENCE (charter Hard Rule 10,
# ex:saNoRemintEvidenceTerms): a fixture that RE-MINTS gmeow:EvidenceSpan as rdfs:isDefinedBy the
# preference slice — the AC7 no-duplication violation (Principle 16). The slice reuses evidence
# terms by-reference only (e.g. gmeow:deltaEvaluationEvidence → gmeow:EvidenceSpan). Unioned with
# the module by the gmeow:saFailWitness teeth check, it makes the ∃-redeclared-term ASK HOLD,
# proving the mustNot ban has teeth. The module must never carry this triple.

@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

gmeow:EvidenceSpan rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/preference> .
